### Zodiacal Releasing (from Aries)

The Zodiacal Releasing engine (core/zodiacal_releasing.py) is ported
from zodiacalreleasing.py in Aries, the astrology software by Max Lange,
which is built on the Morinus project. The period weights, level
durations, Loosing of the Bond rule and releaser handling follow that
code; this project reworked it onto Julian Day numbers and bound it to
zodiac positions. The Aries code is not imported at run time.

The lot formulas used as releasers (core/lots.py) were checked against
the Arabic Parts table that Aries ships (Res/Opts/arabic_parts.json).

- Copyright (c) Max Lange
- License: AGPL-3.0-or-later, the same license as this project, so no
  separate permission is needed; keeping this notice is what the license asks.
- Upstream: https://github.com/primum-mobile/aries (https://aries.sh/)

